        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-035-source-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-035-specimen-match> ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-31-t1917-035-on-the-shapes-of-eggs-and-of-c-audit-v2-thompson1917-t1917-035-1>,
